display_name = "Grundy"
personality = "Grundy is a deep miner who goes where the light doesn't. He's compact, immensely strong, and navigates by touch and air currents. He's found veins others missed, survived cave-ins that killed crews. He speaks in geological time - millions of years, not days. He's searching for the 'Heart of the Island' - a mythical ore body. He sings ancient mining songs that echo in the dark."
